# Changelog

Before claiming implementation work done, follow [`.agents/skills/okm-ship`](.agents/skills/okm-ship/SKILL.md).

- Append notes to `changelog.md` under `## Unreleased`.
- Use `### ✨ Added`, `### 💥 Breaking Changes`, `### ♻️ Changed`, `### ⚠️ Deprecated`, `### 🔥 Removed`, `### 🐛 Fixed`, `### 🔒 Security`.
- When a group has 8 or more bullets, group them under `#### contracts`, `#### dialects`, `#### adapters`, `#### runtime`, `#### tooling`, or `#### docs`.
- Never append under a shipped `## vX.Y.Z` section.
- After the notes, run `bun run bump next`. A gate prompt that releases runs `bun run bump release` instead.
- Skip pure typo or format-only edits.
